  "content": "\n\n<h1>生命吸取附魔</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1327308441324097681?label=discord&color=blue&logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fly-life-steal-enchantment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/ly-life-steal-enchantment?label=modrinth&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/lullaby6/data-packs\" alt=\"License\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252flullaby45743\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://shields.io/badge/ko--fi-donate-ff5f5f?logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"贊助\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252flucianobrumer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://shields.io/badge/paypal-donate-ff5f5f?logo=paypal&color=blue\" alt=\"贊助\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><code>生命吸取</code> 武器附魔，共有 3 個等級，每提升一級，觸發吸取生命值所需的傷害閾值就會降低。</p>\n<p>此附魔可透過附魔台、戰利品寶箱或與村民交易獲得。</p>\n<p>未定義</p>\n<h2>⌨️ 指令</h2>\n<p>給予物品：</p>\n<pre><code>/loot give @s loot life_steal_enchantment:&lt;level&gt;</code></pre>\n<p>賦予附魔：</p>\n<pre><code>/enchant @s life_steal_enchantment:life_steal &lt;level&gt;</code></pre>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🪪 授權條款</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AGPL-3.0-or-later</a></p>\n<p>未定義</p>\n<h2>👾 錯誤/問題</h2>\n<p>請在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a> 回報任何問題、錯誤或缺陷。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>💌 贊助</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252flullaby45743\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Ko-Fi 贊助</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.